  "problem": "The exact value of the area $A$ from part 7 can be expressed using definite integral notation as\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $A={\\int }_{a}^{b}$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\text{d}x,\\,\\,$ where  \n$a\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-2}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,$ and $\\,b\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-3}}",
